<sect2 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" id="gimp-filter-softglow">
  <title>Brilhosuave</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Filtros</primary>
    <secondary>Artísticos</secondary>
    <tertiary>Brilhosuave</tertiary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Brilhosuave</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <sect3>
    <title>Visão-geral</title>
    <figure>
      <title>Example for the <quote>Softglow</quote> filter</title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="JPG" fileref="images/filters/examples/taj_orig.jpg"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>Imagem original</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="JPG" fileref="images/filters/examples/artistic-taj-softglow.jpg"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>Filter applied</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
    <para>
      This filter lights the image with a soft glow, like the old trick 
      smearing vaseline on the lens. Softglow produces this
      effect by making bright areas of the image brighter.
    </para>
  </sect3>

  <sect3>
    <title>Activating the Filter</title>
    <para>
      This filter is found in the main menu under
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Filters</guimenu>
        <guisubmenu>Artistic</guisubmenu>
        <guimenuitem>Softglow…</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>

  <sect3>
    <title>Opções</title>
    <figure>
      <title>Opções do filtro <quote>Brilhosuave</quote></title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/filters/artistic/softglow-dialog.png"/>
        </imageobject>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
    <variablelist>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Presets</term>
        <term><quote>Input Type</quote></term>
        <term>Clipping</term>
        <term>Blending Options</term>
        <term>Pré-visuação</term>
        <term>Merge filter</term>
        <term>Split view</term>
        <listitem>
          <xi:include href="../about-common-features.xml"/>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Raio de brilho</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>O parâmetro de raio de brilho controla a acuidade do efeito, dando um efeito de <quote>vaselina na lente</quote>.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Brilho</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>O  parâmetro de brilho controla o grau de intensificação aplicada à partes claras da imagem.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Acuidade</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>O parâmetro de acuidade controla o quão definida ou alternativa a difusão do efeito de brilho deve ser.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
    </variablelist>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
